            "reviewBody": "My husband raved and raved about this dessert, and he's not big on desserts. The only things I did different is I increased the blackberries to 8 cups and added about 1/2 cup more of flour while it was cooking, this filled the 9 x 13 pan better and made it set up better, less runny.",
