              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Liz G"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my go to cobbler recipe. I now omit the first 4 ingredients and use any of my home canned pie fillings. I usually make make 1.5 recipes for a 9x13 pan because we love plenty of topping. This is a very easy recipe, I always have all the ingredients on hand and can throw it together last minute.",
