              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cmach"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good although I did add 3 extra cups of berries and 1/2 cup flour while cooking as another viewer suggested. That did fill out the pan nicely. I wish I would have added extra sugar because I think the pie could have been better if a little sweeter. Also my berries were store bought and big which could have added to it! I served with ice cream and didn’t receive any complaints!",
